  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. .woodpecker/full-suite.yml test-all-packages still runs one `pytest ... --cov=<all 7 src> --cov-fail-under=100 packages/*/tests/` (lines 107-117); .woodpecker/nightly.yml lines 78-85 do the same; woodpecker.yml per-PR adds --cov for changed packages over a cross-package test selection. No step runs check-package-coverage. The GHA full-suite schedule is commented out. Separate nit: woodpecker.yml:701 still describes full-suite as 'per-package pytest'. Live CI runs were not observed. MECHANISM: every live coverage gate is one union pytest over all packages' tests, so cross-package coverage counts toward 100%. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kahar."  # 3f09
